You coat your bullets with flammable materials, for the next [2, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns each bullet will explode when it hits its target, dealing [76, 103, 123, 141, 156 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] fire damage to all foes within radius 2 (most of your shooting talents fire two bullets at once).

Damage will increase with Steampower.

Only one bullet enhancement can be used at once.
